      "note": "Training used chat style. We tested BOTH\nmodels with BOTH formats. All 500\nquestions were excluded from weight\ntraining; 64 were monitored. Earlier\npretraining exposure is unknown. No\nworked-solution SFT was added. The\noriginal separate 128 test remains 41 to\n80."
    },
